(6733709, 1008140, 509, '<td valign="top">Overexposure and composition hurts this imho.  The subjects are good but I would experiment with some different angles and especially lighting - a dark background and off-camera lighting to compliment the wood grain and pick guard would make the guitars stand out more than pink.</td>', 'Overexposure and composition hurts this imho.  The subjects are good but I would experiment with some different angles and especially lighting - a dark background and off-camera lighting to compliment the wood grain and pick guard would make the guitars stand out more than pink.', '2012-04-05 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6733715, 1007660, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but a little off on the composition - for this to be more effective the escalators should exactly mirror each other.  This could probably be achieved here by moving the camera to the right just a hair (unless the split actually is a mirror in which I suspect that would be impossible).</td>', 'Nice idea but a little off on the composition - for this to be more effective the escalators should exactly mirror each other.  This could probably be achieved here by moving the camera to the right just a hair (unless the split actually is a mirror in which I suspect that would be impossible).', '2012-04-05 22:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
