(6737844, 1007969, 147303, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the muted colors of this photo.  It makes the photograph seem dull and unexciting.  But it was a good concept and I like the even spaces between the chairs.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the muted colors of this photo.  It makes the photograph seem dull and unexciting.  But it was a good concept and I like the even spaces between the chairs.', '2012-04-10 11:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
