(6737846, 1006840, 147303, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of noise and glare in the front of this photo that takes away from the focal point of the trees.  I like black and white for this photo.</td>', 'There is a lot of noise and glare in the front of this photo that takes away from the focal point of the trees.  I like black and white for this photo.', '2012-04-10 11:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6737847, 1008276, 11769, '<td valign="top">In two worlds at once, great catch.</td>', 'In two worlds at once, great catch.', '2012-04-10 11:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6737848, 1008056, 147303, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome photo.  I can almost feel the texture of the powder through the photo, which means you have accomplished a fantastic feat.</td>', 'This is an awesome photo.  I can almost feel the texture of the powder through the photo, which means you have accomplished a fantastic feat.', '2012-04-10 11:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6737849, 1007947, 147303, '<td valign="top">This photo is very ethereal and beautiful.  I love the contrast of the flowers against the black backdrop and the positioning of the vases is ideal.</td>', 'This photo is very ethereal and beautiful.  I love the contrast of the flowers against the black backdrop and the positioning of the vases is ideal.', '2012-04-10 11:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6737850, 1007923, 147303, '<td valign="top">Right away this photo made me smile so it''s a winner!  Very rare to capture the perfect reflection of an animal.</td>', 'Right away this photo made me smile so it''s a winner!  Very rare to capture the perfect reflection of an animal.', '2012-04-10 11:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6737851, 1008206, 147303, '<td valign="top">I really like this concept and love dogs!  I feel like there is too much light ont he noise which causes too much reflection and the eyes are blurry.</td>', 'I really like this concept and love dogs!  I feel like there is too much light ont he noise which causes too much reflection and the eyes are blurry.', '2012-04-10 11:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6737852, 1008239, 147303, '<td valign="top">The birds themselves are graceful, but they blend into the white background which takes away the sharpness and clarity of the subjects.</td>', 'The birds themselves are graceful, but they blend into the white background which takes away the sharpness and clarity of the subjects.', '2012-04-10 11:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6737853, 1007364, 147303, '<td valign="top">This photo has me staring so it is definitely interesting.  I like that the front is a bit blurred, but not unrecongnizable.  Good contrast.</td>', 'This photo has me staring so it is definitely interesting.  I like that the front is a bit blurred, but not unrecongnizable.  Good contrast.', '2012-04-10 11:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
