(6738470, 1008252, 20168, '<td valign="top">For more on Yves Klein check out <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yves_Klein" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yves Klein on Wiki</a> or <a href="//www.yveskleinarchives.org/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yves Klein Archive</a> <br/>So there were a few double takes in looking at this monochromatic photo. Some on DPC still seem to believe there needs to be a subject in order for a photo or art piece to have relevance. Klein thought otherwise. I though eine Kleina Nacht music may be some fun this week on DPC so entered another monochromatic blahblahblah piece.</td>', 'For more on Yves Klein check out Yves Klein on Wiki or Yves Klein Archive So there were a few double takes in looking at this monochromatic photo. Some on DPC still seem to believe there needs to be a subject in order for a photo or art piece to have relevance. Klein thought otherwise. I though eine Kleina Nacht music may be some fun this week on DPC so entered another monochromatic blahblahblah piece.', '2012-04-11 01:32:17.000000', NULL, 0),
